      "location": "2.1",
      "defect": "unlicensed-inference",
      "evidence": "For an open ball, x not in B(a,r) permits |x-a|_p=r, not only >r. Taking such a boundary x and y=x contradicts the step's asserted |y-a|_p=|x-a|_p>r. Replacing >r by >=r repairs the complement argument.",
